            "title": "Stakes raised in chip ban « Week In China",
            "snippets": [
              "# Stakes raised in chip ban\n## Will sanctions on ZTE (and possibly Huawei) trigger a US-China tech war?\n### Keep up to date with a free subscription to our digital magazine, courtesy of HSBC\n\n##### Talking Point\n\nApr 27, 2018 (WiC 406)\n\n- Tweet\n- A   A\n- Print this article\n\nZTE-w\n\nGoing for the jugular: ZTE’s ability to manufacture smartphones will be hampered by US component ban",
